@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
title Teacher reuse
left to right direction
actor Teacher
rectangle "Authorized materials" {
  usecase "UC01 Search related materials" as Search
  usecase "UC02 Attach selected origin" as Attach
  usecase "UC10 Select files and folders" as Batch
}
Teacher --> Search
Teacher --> Attach
Teacher --> Batch
Search -[hidden]down-> Attach
Attach -[hidden]down-> Batch
note right of Search
Filters precede authorized grouping.
One result per content group.
end note
note right of Attach
Preserve the chosen origin declaration.
Strict native copying is refused.
end note
@enduml
